OL,3,ATeenagers to be offered new vocational
OL,4,AGCSE subjects in school
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew vocational GCSEs will be introduced
OL,7,Ffrom 2029 for 14-year-olds alongside
OL,8,Fexisting core academic subjects in
OL,9,FEngland.
OL,11,FThe new subjects could include building
OL,12,Fand construction, business management
OL,13,Fand finance, and child development.
OL,15,FA new national target for employers to
OL,16,Fhelp create 200,000 work experience
OL,17,Fopportunities for under 16s is also
OL,18,Fbeing set by Prime Minister Andy
OL,19,FBurnham, as part of reforms to shake-up
OL,20,Fthe education system to better prepare
OL,21,Fyoung people for the world of work.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
