OL,3,APrison staff told not to use inadequate
OL,4,Acells as overcrowding worsens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrison governors in England and Wales
OL,7,Fhave been warned against using unsafe
OL,8,Fcells to cope with overcrowding,
OL,9,Faccording to documents leaked to the
OL,10,FBBC.
OL,12,FThe six-page letter from the Prison
OL,13,FGovernors' Association (PGA) has been
OL,14,Fsent to members urging them to abide by
OL,15,Fthe law when using cells, ensuring they
OL,16,Fmeet health and safety requirements and
OL,17,Fare suitable for the number of inmates
OL,18,Fthey are holding.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
