OL,3,APrison staff told not to use inadequate
OL,4,Acells as overcrowding worsens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrison staff told the BBC they were
OL,7,Fincreasingly having to put two inmates
OL,8,Fin single occupancy cells, as
OL,9,Fovercrowding across the adult male
OL,10,Festate worsens.
OL,12,F"Keeping two prisoners in cells built
OL,13,Ffor one isn't ideal, but the pressure
OL,14,Fis on to maintain operational capacity.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
